OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner seeks tighter security
OL,4,Aafter break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a shop in a conservation
OL,7,Farea has voiced her frustrations over
OL,8,Fthe difficulties of boosting security
OL,9,Ffollowing two break-ins.
OL,11,FKaren Webb-Meek, who owns Dollie
OL,12,FJewellery and Dollie Tattoos in
OL,13,FCleethorpes, had her premises broken
OL,14,Finto during the early hours of Monday.
OL,15,FShe said thieves returned the following
OL,16,Fnight taking stock worth about #4,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
