OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner seeks tighter security
OL,4,Aafter break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are in a heritage listed building
OL,7,Fso it makes the security of the front
OL,8,Fof the shop pretty difficult because
OL,9,Fthere are things the heritage people
OL,10,Fwill agree and won't agree to us
OL,11,Fhaving," she said.
OL,13,FNorth East Lincolnshire Council said it
OL,14,Fwas considering an application for
OL,15,Fstrengthened glass to be put in.
